"<p>\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" align=\"center\">\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/digikam.png\">\n"
"</td>\n"
"<td>\n"
"... that you could use &lt;Page Down&gt; and &lt;Page Up&gt; on your "
